{"id":"612273","name":"豌豆辣肠炒紫米饭","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/612273/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"隔夜紫米饭","amount":"两碗"},{"name":"辣肠","amount":"少许"},{"name":"豌豆仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:隔夜紫米饭两碗。","img":"images/612273/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯水豌豆仁。","img":"images/612273/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"辣肠切粒，切点蒜末。","img":"images/612273/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋两个。","img":"images/612273/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅放油，将鸡蛋炒熟。","img":"images/612273/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放入辣肠粒，蒜末炒香。","img":"images/612273/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后再放入紫米饭翻炒将米饭炒散。","img":"images/612273/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调点酱油大火炒均匀。","img":"images/612273/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入豌豆仁翻炒均匀即可关火。","img":"images/612273/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"如图所示，完成了。","img":"images/612273/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/612273/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/612273/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}